WEBVTT

00:01:36.910 --> 00:01:39.850
Since the battle with Darkstar
after Valgaav's summoning him...

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:42.610
...our party has been
scattered apart.

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:46.610
After a bunch of weird twists,
I managed to meet up...

00:01:46.690 --> 00:01:48.150
...with Zelgadis and Filia again...

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:53.420
...but that still leaves Gourry,
Amelia, and Xellos separated from us.

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:56.760
Well, Xellos has a habit of turning
up when you least expect him...

00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:59.770
...but then where the heck
are Gourry and Amelia?!

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:04.360
Hey! Gourry! Amelia!
Where'd you two go?!

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:50.110
You're SURE your
predictions are right?

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:54.080
Please leave this to me.
Letting the Fire Dragon King...

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:56.850
...take control of our bodies
is a method of prediction...

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:59.020
...passed down through
the dragon race.

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:03.630
That's all well and good,
but where are Gourry and Amelia?

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:07.860
Well, knowing them,
I'm pretty sure they're fine.

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:12.500
And knowing them, I'M sure
they've stumbled into some trouble.

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:13.330
I see your point.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:14.630
Well, what have you found?

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:16.870
It's not very clear, but...

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:19.940
Is... Is that a fish?

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:25.110
The Fire Dragon King needs to take
some art lessons, don't you think?

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:53.540
I... I'm...

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:56.710
Oh, thank goodness!
You're finally awake.

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:59.670
Um... Uh...

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:03.790
It's all right now.

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:15.060
Fi... Fl-l-l-ISH!!!

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:21.210
Wh-Wh-Who are you people?!

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:25.080
Don't worry.
We mean you no harm.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:27.740
We found you unconscious
on the beach.

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:32.880
I remember...

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:45.630
We were all blasted away
when it happened.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:57.000
Forgive me. You were
running a high fever.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.840
I changed you
out of your clothes.

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:01.700
Oh, is that what happened?

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:05.950
What about the others?!
Miss Lina and Mr. Zelgadis and!

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:10.580
You were the only one
we found on the beach.

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:12.420
I see...

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:17.960
Man, am I hungry.

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:21.230
Everyone left me.
Where'd they all go?

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.970
Why did this have to happen?

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:27.530
Huh? Why me?

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:32.500
So... Your name is Amelia.

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:36.040
My name is Lila,
and this is my father, Honar.

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:38.850
We're glad you're finally awake.

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:40.280
Thanks.

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:43.350
You've been asleep
for a week, Miss Amelia.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.790
I was very worried about you.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:49.590
Forgive me! For being so rude
before to people I owe my life to.

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:51.860
Oh, no.
Don't worry about it.

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:55.370
But how did you come to be
unconscious in such a place?

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:59.800
Right! The truth is, my friends
and I were on a journey...

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.310
...to save the
world from danger!

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:04.570
Oh, how terrible for you.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:07.380
You're not really getting
into this, are you?

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:08.310
And then?

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.280
Right... I can remember
up to the part when...

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:12.750
...we were fighting the dark
lord from the Overworld.

00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:14.550
You were beaten?

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:19.680
That's right...
We were blasted away, so...

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:24.030
B- But, the world
hasn't been destroyed...

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:26.190
...so Darkstar must not
have been summoned.

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:30.300
Miss Amelia,
don't worry yourself over it.

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:33.460
You should rest and
rebuild your strength.

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:37.240
Y- You're right. But still...

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:52.690
Miss Lina... Mr. Zelgadis...
Mr. Gourry... Miss Filia... Mr. Xellos...

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:55.290
I wonder what
happened to them all.

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:59.390
Could I have been the
only one who survived?

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:02.230
Uh-uh! I can't believe that!

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:05.240
If the weakest member of
the team is all right, then!

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:09.730
They all must be somewhere,
looking for me!

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:27.650
Miss Lila?

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:35.300
Kerel!

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:44.140
Lila!

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:45.510
Kerel...

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:46.970
Lila!

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:48.970
Kerel!

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:52.650
I thought you weren't
going to come tonight.

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:56.710
I'm sorry. I couldn't come
until Father was distracted.

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:02.790
It looks like that guy
is Miss Lila's boyfriend!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:07.430
Oh, Kerel, it's so hard
meeting like this.

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:12.570
Some day, your father
will understand. So...

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:14.300
Really?

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:18.240
Yeah. So we have to
bear this until that day.

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:22.570
Still, a human and a
fish person?! Whoa...

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:24.580
What are you two doing there?!

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.250
Father!

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.310
Didn't I tell you I wouldn't
allow you to be together?!

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:34.050
Mr. Honar, please hear us out!

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:37.500
I don't have to listen to
anything you have to say!

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:40.230
Let me go!

00:08:40.530 --> 00:08:41.430
Lila!

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:43.360
I can walk by myself!

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.430
Lila!

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:53.480
Lila...

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:57.550
Wait, please!

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:58.810
Miss Amelia.

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:01.950
Even if I do owe you my life,
seeing you keeping...

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:04.290
...two lovers apart
is inexcusable!

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:07.990
This wrong is something that I,
Amelia Wil Tesla Seyruun...

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.860
...warrior of Love and Justice,
cannot allow!

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:19.140
This is our problem.
It's no concern of yours.

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:23.640
No! Now that I've seen this,
I cannot ignore it!

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:25.100
What?

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:28.740
Mr. Honar! Why won't you allow
these two to be together?

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:32.670
In the end, humans and my
people cannot live together.

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:35.420
It's clear that their
lives will be unhappy!

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:36.890
That's not true!

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:38.090
Exactly!

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:40.090
This is a love that
transcends race!

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:41.520
It's something
to be celebrated!

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:43.990
It's obvious how much
they love each other!

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.760
How could they ever be unhappy?

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:49.530
I said I would not
permit this and I WON'T!

00:10:03.820 --> 00:10:05.410
How cruel!

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:11.120
Hey, you! This is no time to
be standing there brokenhearted!

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:12.120
Snap out of it!

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:17.090
Get going, and convince
Mr. Honar to accept your love!

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:41.370
Mr. Honar, why won't you
allow them to be together?!

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:44.450
And saying it's because they're
different races isn't going to cut it!

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:48.880
It all started 3 months ago.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:52.260
The ship I was on
went down in a storm.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:58.460
Lila saved me after I was swept into
the sea and lost consciousness.

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:22.290
She was injured,
all for my sake...

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:25.790
It's all right, Kerel.
Don't worry about that.

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:26.920
Lila...

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:28.060
Kerel...

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:33.790
Anyway, please accept that these
two are in love with each other!

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:36.800
In the end, love is
a temporary thing.

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:38.270
That's not!

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:41.770
Love fades, even between
those of the same race.

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:46.510
Between those of different races,
it will fade even faster.

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:49.450
Our love isn't that shallow!

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:54.180
Once, long ago, there were
two lovers like you.

00:11:55.920 --> 00:12:00.730
But we fish people need to spend
half of each day in the water.

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:05.100
It was all right for a while.

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:10.270
But as the years passed, the
human couldn't stand it any longer.

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:15.600
The dampness of their house,
nothing but sea weed meals.

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:19.110
Never being able to travel
together very far from the sea.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.810
How could they
not grow to hate it?

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:23.850
You're saying that you?

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:29.150
It's an old story. A very,
very old and common tale.

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:32.660
And I don't want Lila
to suffer like that.

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:33.990
Father...

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:37.030
But that won't happen with me!

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:42.030
Even a lifetime of damp rooms
and sea weed wouldn't matter!

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:43.800
I'd never, ever leave Lila!

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.940
Not even a bed that
will always be slimy?

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:49.030
Or meals of slugs
and earthworms?

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.270
That is kinda gross, actually.

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:55.750
Why did we have to be
born to different races?!

00:12:56.250 --> 00:13:00.420
If only... If only I were human,
we wouldn't have to suffer like this!

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:02.460
It's not your fault, Lila.

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:09.850
Maybe we should
say goodbye now...

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.330
...while we still have good
memories of each other.

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:14.060
Lila...

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:25.980
It's over, Kerel.

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:27.340
Lila!

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:31.940
W- Wait, please! Can you
two really live with this?!

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:33.040
But...

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:35.780
You can't just
give up like this!

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:38.330
You have to hang onto
your love to the very end!

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:39.650
Miss Amelia...

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:42.860
Don't give up till
we've tried everything!

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:46.700
If you get used to it, you might
be able to handle slimy beds...

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:48.930
...and salt water baths
without any problems!

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.530
Let's try our best, Lila.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.000
Kerel...

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:59.340
If you mean that, there is
one thing we could try.

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:08.620
Found it! Here it is!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:11.360
This is the ancient
treasure of transformation...

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:12.790
...passed down through my race?

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:13.660
That's right.

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:17.460
With this, we'll be able to
turn Miss Lila into a human.

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:21.900
There is a secret treasure of
transformation among our race.

00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:24.370
Those who gain it...

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:27.900
"...will be able to
freely change their form."

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:30.200
With this...

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:31.040
Kerel!

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:32.200
Lila!

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:38.380
Okay! Now all we need to
do is get the treasure!

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:42.450
But it says we need
a beautiful princess...

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.620
...to summon the
guardian of the treasure.

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:47.090
A beautiful princess...

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:55.260
If it says that, Miss Lila
won't be any good, will she?

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:56.860
I'll have to handle it.

00:14:56.940 --> 00:15:00.700
Miss Amelia won't do at all
for this. I'll have to do it.

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:04.840
Mr. Gourry!

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:10.610
Wh- What happened to him?!
What turned him into this?!

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:13.940
He was collapsed just up ahead.
We picked him up.

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:15.350
Mr. Gourry!

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:17.860
I'm... hungry...

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:23.260
He must have been starving.

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:25.160
No, he always eats like this.

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.330
But this solves our
problem, doesn't it?

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:35.140
WHYARE YOU
DOI NG THIS TO ME?!!!

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:39.140
We need a beautiful woman
to summon the guardian...

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:41.440
...of the fish people's
secret treasure!

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:43.510
So why are you using ME?!

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:46.320
What's the problem?
It said a "beautiful" woman, right?

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:48.920
Besides, they gave you
food and shelter, didn't they?!

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:51.690
Do your best for these two!

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:53.860
Now just a minute! HEY!!!

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:55.890
Will he be all right?

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:58.230
Mr. Gourry's a big, tough guy...

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:01.630
...so he'll be okay if the
guardian takes a bite out of him.

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:03.140
A bite out of him?

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:09.000
AGH! Lemme go! Hey, Amelia!
Do something! Please!

00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:22.680
Huh? What's that?
Why'd it get so quiet?

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:24.780
Looks like it'll be soon...

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:36.700
Hey, what's?!

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:42.380
Hold it!
Let's talk this out!

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:43.410
There it is!

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:46.040
That's the treasure
of transformation?

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:49.340
If I swallow an extract of it,
I can become human!

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:55.720
Why do these stupid chains
have to be so strong?!

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:00.530
DAMN IT ALL!!!

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:08.430
You gotta be kidding! You think
I'd let that thing bite me?!

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:16.100
Now's our chance, while
Mr. Gourry's distracting it!

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:21.480
Don't move so much!

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:24.540
Mr. Gourry, let him just
have a little nibble!

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:26.450
Please try to get him
to stand still!

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:28.280
Like hell I am!

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:31.220
But I can't get a
clear shot like this!

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:36.250
This is making it
even harder to get!

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:45.030
I did it!

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:47.470
Mr. Gourry!
All right, then!

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:49.280
DIGGER BOLT!

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:51.470
No, you idiot!

00:17:56.980 --> 00:17:58.750
- Now!
- Right!

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:03.880
Here it comes. And... heave!

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:05.820
We did it!

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:09.330
This is it...
The treasure we wanted.

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:10.890
We did it.

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:13.060
Victory!

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:15.470
Now, just a minute....

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:20.610
Oh, what the heck.

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:29.380
Miss Amelia! Mr. Gourry!

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:31.210
Take care of this, okay?

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:34.550
Hey, no fair!

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:46.200
Lila, you're sure about this?

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:47.500
Yes.

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:50.900
Now Miss Lila will
turn into a human.

00:18:50.970 --> 00:18:52.460
What KI ND of human, exactly?

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:58.640
Lila!

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:03.540
What's wrong?

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:04.380
Why won't I?

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:06.980
As I feared...

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:12.090
According to our race's legend,
that potion only becomes active...

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:18.570
...with the kiss by a human and
a fish person who truly love each other.

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:22.790
If their love is true, the human
will become a fish person...

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:24.900
...and the fish person
will become a human...

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:26.170
...by exchanging their forms.

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:30.340
Meaning Lila becomes a human
and Kerel becomes a fish man?

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:33.010
That doesn't solve
the problem at all!

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.470
It doesn't matter to me.

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:40.220
If I become a fish man,
I can live on this island.

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:41.920
What more can I ask for?

00:19:43.560 --> 00:19:45.620
All we need now is
to know how Lila feels.

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:49.620
I... I'm not afraid
of becoming human.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:51.000
Lila!

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:22.520
Kerel...

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:23.860
Lila!

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:26.920
You look so wonderful now!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:28.530
So do you.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:34.830
They have proved their love.

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:36.770
When I think back
to that other time...

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:39.940
...I remember how I lacked
the courage to become human.

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:42.950
And lost so much
because of it...

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:48.450
Mr. Honar, Miss Lila
will have happiness now.

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:50.720
Enough for you, as well.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.370
Um... Is this really
such a good idea?

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.960
If they're both happy,
it's just fine!

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:23.380
Huh?! You've become
Warriors ofJustice...

00:22:23.450 --> 00:22:24.820
...and are out
hunting for demons?!

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:28.340
Gourry and Amelia have really gotten
mixed up in some crazy stuff now!

00:22:28.420 --> 00:22:29.980
Next time, " The Right Person
in the Right Place!"

00:22:30.060 --> 00:22:31.520
"Amelia in the Village ofJustice!"

00:22:31.590 --> 00:22:33.860
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
